{"seq":1,"slug":"objective-tracking","title":"目标追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-quest-objective-systems/tracking/objective-tracking","wordCount":1365,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"目标追踪\">目标追踪</h1><p>玩家在「屠狼契约」里砍倒第五只灰狼的那一帧，发生了一串精确的传导：战斗系统广播一个「敌人死亡」事件，任务系统里某个正在监听的目标把计数从 4 加到 5，这个目标判定自己达标，向上冒泡到阶段，阶段聚合后告诉日志 UI「进度变了，刷新一下」。这一篇只讲这条传导链的中段——进度如何被记录、如何逐层聚合成「任务完成度」、以及界面如何感知它。进度从哪来由 <a href=\"../logic/triggers-conditions\">触发与条件</a> 负责，状态如何因此迁移由 <a href=\"../logic/quest-state-machine\">任务状态机</a> 负责，这里专注「计数与聚合」本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-进度是一棵聚合树\">核心概念：进度是一棵聚合树</h2><p>目标追踪的心智模型是一棵自底向上聚合的树。叶子是单个目标的计数，中间是阶段的完成度，根是任务的整体进度。每一层只关心「我的孩子们达标了没」，不关心孩子内部怎么算。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  E[战斗/拾取/到达&lt;br/&gt;世界事件] --&gt; O1[目标 击败灰狼&lt;br/&gt;4/5]&#10;  E --&gt; O2[目标 击败头狼&lt;br/&gt;0/1]&#10;  O1 --&gt; SA[阶段 清剿狼群&lt;br/&gt;完成度聚合]&#10;  O2 --&gt; SA&#10;  SA --&gt; Q[任务整体进度&lt;br/&gt;当前阶段 2/3]&#10;  Q --&gt; UI[日志/标记 订阅刷新]&#10;  Q --&gt; SM[状态机 判定 Active to Completed]\">flowchart TD\n  E[战斗/拾取/到达&lt;br/&gt;世界事件] --&gt; O1[目标 击败灰狼&lt;br/&gt;4/5]\n  E --&gt; O2[目标 击败头狼&lt;br/&gt;0/1]\n  O1 --&gt; SA[阶段 清剿狼群&lt;br/&gt;完成度聚合]\n  O2 --&gt; SA\n  SA --&gt; Q[任务整体进度&lt;br/&gt;当前阶段 2/3]\n  Q --&gt; UI[日志/标记 订阅刷新]\n  Q --&gt; SM[状态机 判定 Active to Completed]</pre><p>不同游戏对「完成度」的定义不同，下表对比几种常见的聚合语义：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>聚合语义</th>\n<th>阶段达标条件</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>进度条表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全部完成（AND）</td>\n<td>所有目标均达标</td>\n<td>「集齐三种材料」</td>\n<td>各目标加权求和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任一完成（OR）</td>\n<td>任一目标达标</td>\n<td>「用任意手段击败 Boss」</td>\n<td>取最大单项进度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阈值完成（K of N）</td>\n<td>至少 K 个目标达标</td>\n<td>「完成五个支线中的三个」</td>\n<td>已达标项数 / K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计数累加</td>\n<td>单一计数到达上限</td>\n<td>「击败 10 只狼」</td>\n<td>当前计数 / 上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"计数模型与归一化\">计数模型与归一化</h2><p>最常见的目标是「计数型」：需要某事件发生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次。运行时只需存一个整数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 与上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，归一化进度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = \\min(c, n) / n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。这里有两个务必处理的边界：一是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 必须被钳制（clamp）在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, n]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，否则一次批量击杀可能让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 越过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，导致进度条超过 100% 或后续判定错乱——这是 <a href=\"../practice/quest-pitfalls\">陷阱与边界</a> 里反复出现的「计数越界」；二是可减计数（如「保持声望 ≥ 50」这类会回退的目标）必须允许 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 下降，这类目标不能用「单调递增」的假设去优化。</p>\n<p>阶段级进度则是各目标进度的加权聚合。若阶段是 AND 语义，最朴素的整体进度是平均：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>stage</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{stage}} = \\frac{1}{m}\\sum_{i=1}^{m} p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是目标数。但平均会让「99% 完成的大目标」和「刚开始的小目标」被同等对待，体验上不够准，因此很多系统给每个目标一个权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>stage</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{stage}} = \\sum w_i p_i / \\sum w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。权重一般写在任务定义里，属于 <a href=\"../foundations/quest-data-model\">任务数据模型</a> 的元数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件驱动而非每帧轮询\">事件驱动而非每帧轮询</h2><p>天真的实现会在每帧检查「玩家背包里狼皮够不够了」。在有几十个活跃任务、每个任务多个目标时，这种轮询是纯粹的浪费，且把任务系统和被监听系统耦合死。成熟做法是反过来：目标向相关系统<strong>注册一个监听</strong>，只在事件真正发生时被回调。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  subgraph 被监听系统&#10;    K[战斗系统] --&gt;|敌人死亡事件| BUS[事件总线]&#10;    INV[背包系统] --&gt;|物品变化事件| BUS&#10;  end&#10;  BUS --&gt; M[任务系统订阅器&lt;br/&gt;按事件类型路由]&#10;  M --&gt;|匹配的目标| UPD[更新计数 + 钳制]&#10;  UPD --&gt;|进度变化| AGG[向上聚合]&#10;  AGG --&gt;|脏标记| RENDER[下一帧刷新订阅者]\">flowchart TD\n  subgraph 被监听系统\n    K[战斗系统] --&gt;|敌人死亡事件| BUS[事件总线]\n    INV[背包系统] --&gt;|物品变化事件| BUS\n  end\n  BUS --&gt; M[任务系统订阅器&lt;br/&gt;按事件类型路由]\n  M --&gt;|匹配的目标| UPD[更新计数 + 钳制]\n  UPD --&gt;|进度变化| AGG[向上聚合]\n  AGG --&gt;|脏标记| RENDER[下一帧刷新订阅者]</pre><p>注意图里的「脏标记」：进度更新不应同步地、立刻地去重画 UI，而是标记「这个任务脏了」，在帧末统一通知订阅者。一次批量击杀可能在同一帧触发多次计数更新，脏标记保证 UI 只刷新一次，避免抖动与重复音效。订阅器按事件类型建索引（如「监听敌人死亡的目标集合」），让单次事件的派发是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为关心该事件的目标数）而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（全部目标）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"进度的恢复与重订阅\">进度的恢复与重订阅</h2><p>读档后，计数本身能从存档恢复（它是 <a href=\"../practice/quest-persistence\">任务持久化</a> 序列化的少数可变数据之一），但「监听」是运行时对象，不会被序列化。因此恢复任务时必须<strong>按当前阶段的目标定义重新注册所有监听</strong>，否则会出现经典的「读档后杀狼不计数」——状态机显示 Active，进度却永远卡住。这与 <a href=\"../logic/quest-state-machine\">任务状态机</a> 里强调的「读档后重新订阅世界事件」是同一件事，只是这里落到目标粒度。</p>\n<p>还有一类隐蔽问题是「追溯计数」：玩家在接任务前就已经攒了 3 块矿石，接任务后该不该直接算 3？这取决于设计，但系统要有能力查询当前世界状态来初始化计数，而不是只能从 0 开始累加。这要求被监听系统同时提供「事件流」与「当前快照」两种接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>目标追踪的心智模型是一棵自底向上聚合的树：目标计数 → 阶段完成度 → 任务整体进度。</li>\n<li>阶段聚合有 AND / OR / K-of-N / 计数累加等语义，按任务定义选择，可带权重。</li>\n<li>计数必须钳制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, n]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，并区分单调递增与可回退目标，防越界。</li>\n<li>用事件驱动 + 按事件类型建索引取代每帧轮询；进度变化只打脏标记，帧末统一刷新。</li>\n<li>读档后必须按当前阶段重新注册监听；按需支持从世界快照追溯初始化计数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>进度从哪来、事件如何匹配：<a href=\"../logic/triggers-conditions\">触发与条件</a></li>\n<li>聚合后的进度如何呈现给玩家：<a href=\"quest-log\">任务日志</a></li>\n<li>计数越界与读档卡死的成因：<a href=\"../practice/quest-pitfalls\">陷阱与边界</a></li>\n<li>进度数据如何切片进存档：<a href=\"../practice/quest-persistence\">任务持久化</a></li>\n<li>玩家反馈的呈现原则：<a href=\"../../game-ui-ux/foundations/player-feedback\">游戏 UI/UX · 玩家反馈</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"目标追踪","id":"目标追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：进度是一棵聚合树","id":"核心概念-进度是一棵聚合树"},{"level":2,"text":"计数模型与归一化","id":"计数模型与归一化"},{"level":2,"text":"事件驱动而非每帧轮询","id":"事件驱动而非每帧轮询"},{"level":2,"text":"进度的恢复与重订阅","id":"进度的恢复与重订阅"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"前置与分支","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-quest-objective-systems/logic/prerequisites-branching"},"next":{"title":"任务日志","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-quest-objective-systems/tracking/quest-log"}}